    "Scan of the 1997 edition of the Reid, North Carolina, topographic map at 1:24,000 scale (7.5 x 7.5 minute series), published by the U.S. Geological Survey. Aerial photographs from 1987; field checked in 1946; photo inspected in 1997; last revised in 2001; printed in 2001.",
